msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 6,000.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Action: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hard Slash</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
