msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 3,000.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Junction Tank Bonus: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Creates a barrier around self that absorbs damage equivalent to a heal of 6,000 potency<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>7s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Junction DPS Bonus: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases potency to 5,000<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Junction Healer Bonus: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Restores own HP and the HP of nearby party members within a radius of 15 yalms<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>4,000<br>Can only be executed when <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Ready to Gouge</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
