msgid "Delivers a ranged attack with a potency of 8,000.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Maximum Charges: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>3<br>This weaponskill does not share a recast timer with any other actions.<br><br>※Action changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hyosho Ranryu</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Three Mudra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
