msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 18,000.<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Three Mudra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
