msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 6,000.<br><br>※Action changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hyosetsu</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Kaiten</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
