msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 8,000.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants a stack of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Immortal Sacrifice</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, up to a maximum of 8<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Maximum Charges: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>2<br>This weaponskill does not share a recast timer with any other actions."
