msgid "Deals wind damage with a potency of 5,000.<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>White Shift</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Dualcast</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
